{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"地形技法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"erosion-simulation","title":"侵蚀模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques/erosion-simulation","wordCount":1194,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"biome-distribution","title":"生物群落分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques/biome-distribution","wordCount":1242,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"terrain-features","title":"地形特征生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/techniques/terrain-features","wordCount":1273,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"地形技法\">地形技法</h1><p>从噪声场到可信地貌需要一套专门算法：侵蚀模拟雕刻出被水流冲刷的峡谷，生物群落系统将地形划分为沙漠、森林、雪原等有意义的区域，地形特征生成在全局框架下叠加山脉、河道、悬崖等有辨识度的地质特征。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"erosion-simulation\">侵蚀模拟</a></td>\n<td>液压侵蚀粒子算法与热力侵蚀，将光滑噪声雕刻为真实地貌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"biome-distribution\">生物群落分布</a></td>\n<td>温湿度双轴 Whittaker 图、Voronoi 生物群落分区与混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"terrain-features\">地形特征生成</a></td>\n<td>山脉控制曲线、河道生成、悬崖与特征叠加</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}